RT-DETR and RT-DETRv2
Upstream: https://github.com/lyuwenyu/RT-DETR
Copyright notices in the individual source files are retained.
License: Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE in this directory.

This directory contains selected Python source and model architecture
configurations from the local upstream-derived project. It is not a complete
upstream checkout. We omit Git history, weights, datasets, result folders,
training command-line entry points and training recipe configurations.
Architecture configurations set pretrained=False to avoid implicit downloads.
The original general-purpose support modules are retained for import compatibility.
No private radar-vision training protocol is included.
Inference package initialization registers model components only; optional data
and optimizer modules require explicit imports. RT-DETRv2's TensorBoard import
is deferred until a summary writer is requested, so inference does not require it.
The custom dataset DataLoader import is likewise deferred until distributed
loader wrapping is requested.

Published inference/export entry points require explicit output destinations
and external model-weight paths; no repository-local weight directory is assumed.
Unused training imports were removed from the legacy image-inference script.
Optional Transformers/RegNet and TensorRT imports are deferred until requested.
